{
  "title": "Secrets Manager · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "DB 비밀번호와 API 키를 보관하고 교체를 관리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Secrets Manager</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#guide-1\">애플리케이션에서 사용하는 흐름</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#guide-2\">교체와 복구 계획</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>47 / 62</span></div><h1>Secrets Manager</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Secrets Manager는 <strong>데이터베이스 비밀번호나 외부 API 키 같은 비밀값을 보관하고 관리하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 소스 코드나 서버 이미지에 비밀값을 넣는 대신 실행할 때 권한을 확인하고 가져오게 할 수 있습니다.</p><p>비밀값은 암호화해 보관하며 버전과 접근 권한을 관리합니다. 지원되는 구성에서는 주기적으로 값을 교체하는 자동 교체<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>도 설정할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"secrets-and-versions\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"automatic-rotation\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"retrieval-and-client-side-caching\"></span><h2>애플리케이션에서 사용하는 흐름</h2><p>비밀값을 저장하고 애플리케이션 역할에 필요한 비밀값 읽기 권한만 부여합니다. 애플리케이션은 실행 시 값을 가져와 DB 연결 등에 사용합니다.</p><p>비밀값을 로그에 남기지 않고, 반복 조회 비용과 지연을 줄이기 위해 클라이언트 캐시를 사용할 수 있습니다. 캐시를 쓰면 교체된 값이 언제 반영될지도 정해야 합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"iam-resource-policies-and-kms\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"replication-and-regional-recovery\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"private-access-and-audit\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"parameter-store-comparison\"></span><h2>교체와 복구 계획</h2><p>비밀값을 바꾸는 작업은 저장된 값뿐 아니라 실제 데이터베이스나 외부 서비스의 자격 증명에도 반영되어야 합니다. 교체 절차와 애플리케이션의 재연결 동작을 함께 검증합니다.</p><p>다른 리전에 비밀값을 복제하는 기능과 비공개 접근을 위한 VPC 엔드포인트를 필요에 맞춰 사용합니다. 일반 설정값 저장은 Parameter Store와 비용·기능을 비교합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>비밀값을 코드 밖에서 관리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>Secrets Manager</strong><span>비밀값·버전 보관</span></li><li><strong>IAM 권한 확인</strong><span>허용된 앱만 조회</span></li><li><strong>애플리케이션</strong><span>DB·외부 API 연결</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">비밀값의 저장, 조회 권한, 실제 사용처의 교체를 하나의 운영 흐름으로 봅니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>RDS 비밀번호를 Secrets Manager에 저장하고 애플리케이션 역할로 읽습니다. 교체 후에는 기존 연결을 정리하고 새 값으로 재연결하도록 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>자동 교체</strong> — 주기 또는 요청에 따라 새 비밀값을 만들고 실제 사용처와 저장된 값을 갱신하는 과정입니다. 대상에 따라 관리형 교체나 Lambda 기반 절차를 사용합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/intro.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS Secrets Manager? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q065/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q065\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q065\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q065</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q065/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to store an application database password outside its code and rotate it periodically. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q065\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a KMS key alias</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q065\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q065\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q065\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값의 저장·조회·교체에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2,3\" data-question=\"Q088\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q088\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q088</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q088/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Lambda functions connect to a private RDS database. Which TWO services address connection spikes and secure storage of credentials?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Route 53 weighted record</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결을 풀링하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q062\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q063\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q063\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q063</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q063/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The IAM Allow takes precedence</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The action is denied by the SCP restriction</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 최대 권한 경계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>의 Allow만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>의 제한을 넘을 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q068\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">이전 용어 <b>S3 Storage Classes</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">다음 용어 <b>Security Group</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
